==Trivia==
*This Ben's design is a stylized version of 10/11-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]'s regular appearance in the '''Original Series''' and [[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|'''Omniverse''']] flashbacks.
*Original Series Ben's last on-screen line, "Guess I'll smell ya later", quotes a similar line from ''[[Goodbye and Good Riddance]]''.
*The reason why Original Series Ben used only Heatblast during ''Alien X-Tinction'' was due to time constraints and design costs.{{Refn|[[:File:Alternate Bens Limited Aliens Explanation.png]]|group = DR}}
*[[Duncan Rouleau]] originally stated that the four alternate Bens featured in ''Alien X-Tinction'' are the same as [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]] from the previous four series.{{Refn|group=DR|[[:File:All Alternate Bens are Classic Ben.png]]}} However, he later rescinded that statement, stating that they are from alternate timelines.{{Refn|[[:File:AXT Bens are not Prime.png]]|group = DR}}
**[[Cartoon Network]] already indicated this, when it said in the description of a video that [[Ben Tennyson (Alien Force Homage Dimension)|'''Alien Force''' Ben]] and [[Ben Tennyson (Ultimate Alien Homage Dimension)|'''Ultimate Alien''' Ben]] are from different dimensions.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/6aZT9D1S5Oc|group = CN}}

